            "q": "Is private label possible?",
            "a": "Tape Solutions describes private-label work. Explain your preferred presentation, application and approximate quantity so the options can be discussed."
          },
          {
            "q": "How do I select a tape for my application?",
            "a": "Start with the substrate, purpose, conditions and dimensions. Check the published specifications of the product you are considering and ask for advice when the application is uncertain."
          },
          {
            "q": "Can I request a quotation online?",
            "a": "Yes. The quotation form lets you describe a material, quantity, dimensions and any additional requirements. It is an enquiry, not an order."
          },
          {
            "q": "What should I include in my message?",
            "a": "A description of the task and relevant dimensions is a good start. You may also include the surface, conditions and estimated quantity if known."
          },
          {
            "q": "Where can I find the company details?",
            "a": "The contact page shows the published address and registration numbers for Tape Solutions in Capelle aan den IJssel."
          },
          {
            "q": "Does the website guarantee particular delivery times or certifications?",
            "a": "No. Specific availability, delivery and product suitability need to be confirmed for the requested product or project."
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "cta": {
      "title": "Still have a question?",
      "text": "Describe your application, and we will discuss the next step.",
      "label": "Send a message",
      "slug": "contact"
    }
